# README has no charts

`README.md` status is **markdown tables only**. Do not add:

- mermaid fences (`` ```mermaid ``, `xychart-beta`, etc.)
- `docs/decomp-progress.svg` or any `![…](*.svg)` progress image

`python3 tools/decomp/progress.py --write` regenerates the Status block and **must not** inject those. If you need a chart, keep it in `docs/` (`decomp-status.md` / `decomp-progress.svg`), not the README.
